{"id":"n57331-1-7","stage":1,"title":"치마 · 裙","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57331-1-7-1","ko":"이 치마가 저한테 잘 어울릴까요?","zh":"这条裙子我穿会合适吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치마가","meaning":"裙，裙子","explanation":"치마：裙，裙子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"치마","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57331","senseId":"1","lemma":"치마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好看地，漂亮地","explanation":"잘：好看地，漂亮地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울릴까요?","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b967dea5488a0b55","term":"치마","zh":"裙，裙子","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3","entryId":"57331","definition":"一种女性下身穿的没有裤腿部分的外衣。","pronunciation":["치마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好看地，漂亮地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常帅气而美丽地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/555f3ddbcc8acdb8cd6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57331-1-7-2","ko":"네, 손님은 바지보다 치마를 입는 게 더 여성스러워 보여요.","zh":"是的，您穿裙子比穿裤子看起来更显女性化。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님은","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바지보다","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치마를","meaning":"裙，裙子","explanation":"치마：裙，裙子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"치마","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57331","senseId":"1","lemma":"치마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입는","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여성스러워","meaning":"显出女性气质","explanation":"여성：女性（여성스럽다：显出女性气质）；스럽：表示带有前面名词所说的性质或感觉。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"여성","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67727","senseId":"1","lemma":"여성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"b967dea5488a0b55","term":"치마","zh":"裙，裙子","audio":"/audio/b967dea5488a0b55846e.mp3","entryId":"57331","definition":"一种女性下身穿的没有裤腿部分的外衣。","pronunciation":["치마"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"f414772fbd2cdd33","term":"여성","zh":"女性（여성스럽다：显出女性气质）","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3","entryId":"67727","definition":"女性（여성스럽다：显出女性气质）","pronunciation":["여성"]},{"id":"